1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:22,300
Two ways to check prices: the Talented app, or your browser (link below this video)

2
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:33,900
How to install the Talented app on your phone

3
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:42,780
Open the price list on your phone and tap "Pasang Aplikasi Talented" at the top.

4
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:53,130
Android: in Chrome, open the three-dot menu and choose "Install app" or "Add to Home screen".

5
00:00:53,730 --> 00:01:04,770
Option not showing? Make sure the page has fully loaded over HTTPS, then try again.

6
00:01:05,370 --> 00:01:15,930
iPhone or iPad: open the page in Safari and tap Share (the box with an up arrow).

7
00:01:16,530 --> 00:01:23,950
Then choose "Add to Home Screen". Scroll the Share menu if you can't see it.

8
00:01:24,550 --> 00:01:33,600
Keep the name "Talented" and tap Add. If available, turn on "Open as Web App".

9
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:46,420
Done! The Talented icon is now on your home screen. Free, no Play Store or App Store needed.

10
00:01:47,020 --> 00:02:01,590
Free consultation: linktr.ee/talentededucationgroup. All prices are estimates; final amounts follow the school's offer letter.

11
00:02:02,500 --> 00:02:11,000
App installed. Now let's check prices – same steps in the app or the browser

12
00:02:11,600 --> 00:02:23,720
How to use the TEG study cost price list – Australia & New Zealand

13
00:02:24,320 --> 00:02:38,870
Open the price list page and pick your language at the top right – 8 languages are available.

14
00:02:39,470 --> 00:02:50,750
The menu: study programmes, English, pathways, other schools, VSA courses, jobs & accommodation, and start your application.

15
00:02:51,350 --> 00:03:02,900
Choose Australia or New Zealand, then Offshore (still in Indonesia) or Onshore (already there).

16
00:03:03,500 --> 00:03:14,880
Search by course or school, then filter by city, field, level and maximum upfront cost.

17
00:03:15,480 --> 00:03:30,820
Pick your OSHC provider – insurance is recalculated. Enter your IELTS/PTE score to check English requirements.

18
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:42,250
Sort by cheapest, upfront cost, total study cost, recommended bank balance, A–Z or duration.

19
00:03:42,850 --> 00:03:58,860
Each card shows upfront cost, total study cost and recommended bank balance, with an IDR estimate.

20
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:10,120
Open Programme details to see tuition per period, material and enrolment fees, and the upfront periods.

21
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:22,680
Upfront cost, minimum bank balance for the visa, and a refund policy summary with its official source.

22
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:34,710
Download a PDF or send it to WhatsApp; Start your application and Ask a TEG consultant are on every card.

23
00:04:35,310 --> 00:04:46,670
Tick Compare on two or more programmes, then click Compare selected programmes.

24
00:04:47,270 --> 00:04:56,150
Save all search results at once as a PDF, or send the list to WhatsApp.

25
00:04:56,750 --> 00:05:09,350
English (ELICOS) shows weekly course fees; a TEG consultant calculates the upfront cost for your number of weeks.

26
00:05:09,950 --> 00:05:19,240
Pathway packages: VET at one school, then a Bachelor at another; each school issues its own CoE.

27
00:05:19,840 --> 00:05:27,020
Other schools links to the official CRICOS directory to check registered schools.

28
00:05:27,620 --> 00:05:47,110
English courses (VSA): Basic English, PTE Foundation and IELTS/PTE Preparation, online and offline, priced in IDR.

29
00:05:47,710 --> 00:06:03,150
Jobs & Accommodation: jobs checked daily, official visa work-hour rules and accommodation providers. Never pay to get a job.

30
00:06:03,750 --> 00:06:22,500
Start your application: document checklist, process steps and the Student Information Form (PDF/Excel).

31
00:06:23,100 --> 00:06:35,610
Install the Talented app on your phone or tablet – see the separate how-to video.

32
00:06:36,210 --> 00:06:50,450
All prices are estimates; final amounts follow the school's official offer letter.
